English summary: The MIT license in LICENSE covers the code of this project.
The font files in schriften/ are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1;
their license texts sit next to them and must accompany any redistribution.
The animal recordings in toene/ come from Wikimedia Commons and keep their own
licenses (public domain, CC0, CC BY, CC BY-SA); source, author and license of
each file are listed above. They were trimmed, mixed to mono, filtered,
loudness-normalized and re-encoded as MP3. The spoken animal names
(toene/name-*.mp3) were synthesized with Piper and the voice
de_DE-thorsten-high, trained on the CC0 Thorsten-Voice dataset.
